{
  "title": "Calcium\u2013phosphate coupling does not establish incremental pulse-pressure prediction across NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "Across separately recruited NHANES2011\u201312 and2013\u201314 complete-case adults, a source-trained calcium\u2013phosphate interaction changed target weighted MSE by -0.045452mmHg\u00b2 (baseline-minus-augmented; positive is improvement), with joint source-refit/target rescaled-PSU bootstrap95% interval [-1.118442,0.628282]; incremental prediction is not established.",
